"upplösning på ~1 km från januari 1999 till juni 2020. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Averages the daily Soil Water Index product over 10 days. The data are "
"produced every 10 days over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2007 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."
msgstr ""
"Beräknar medelvärdet av den dagliga produkten Soil Water Index över 10 "
"dagar. Data produceras var tionde dag över hela jorden med en spatial "
"upplösning på 0,1° och med tidsomfånget från januari 2007 till 2025. Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."

msgid ""
"Provides daily updates on the moisture conditions in different soil layers. "
"The data are available over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2007 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller dagliga uppdateringar av fuktförhållandena i olika "
"jordlager. Data finns tillgängliga över hela jorden med en spatial "
"upplösning på 0,1° och med tidsomfånget från januari 2007 till 2025. Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-water-"
"index-global-v3-0-12-5km)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the moisture condition at various depths in the soil. Daily "
"observations are available for the continental Europe in the spatial "
"resolution of 1 km and with the temporal extent from January 2015 to 2025. "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-europe-v1-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Kvantifierar fuktförhållandena på olika djup i marken. Dagliga "
"observationer finns tillgängliga för kontinentala Europa med en spatial "
"upplösning på 1 km och med tidsomfånget från januari 2015 till 2025. Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-water-"
"index-europe-v1-0-1km)."

#. LOT2
msgid ""
"Detects the areas covered by inland water providing the maximum and the "
"minimum extent of the water surface as well as the seasonal dynamics. "
"10-daly data are available at global scale in the spatial resolution of 300 "
"m and with the temporal extent from 2014 to 2020. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Upptäcker områden som täcks av inlandsvatten och anger vattenytans maximala "
"och minimala utbredning samt säsongsdynamiken. Data för vart tionde dygn "
"finns tillgängliga i global skala med en spatial upplösning på 300 m och "
"med tidsomfånget från 2014 till 2020. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Detects the areas covered by inland water providing the maximum and the "
"minimum extent of the water surface as well as the seasonal dynamics. "
"Monthly updates are available at global scale in the spatial resolution of "
"300 m and with the temporal extent from 2020 to present More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Upptäcker områden som täcks av inlandsvatten och anger vattenytans maximala "
"och minimala utbredning samt säsongsdynamiken. Månatliga uppdateringar "
"finns tillgängliga i global skala med en spatial upplösning på 300 m och "
"med tidsomfånget från 2020 till nutid. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides for the Northern Hemisphere daily updates of the equivalent amount "
"of liquid water stored in the snow pack. The data is available in the "
"spatial resolution of 5 km and with the temporal extent from January 2006 "
"to June 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v1-"
"0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller dagliga uppdateringar för norra halvklotet av den "
"motsvarande mängden flytande vatten som lagras i snötäcket. Data finns "
"tillgängliga med en spatial upplösning på 5 km och med tidsomfånget från "
"januari 2006 till juni 2024. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v1-0"
"-5km)."

msgid ""
"Provides for the Northern Hemisphere daily updates of the equivalent amount "
"of liquid water stored in the snow pack. The data is available in near real "
"time in the spatial resolution of 5 km and with the temporal extent from "
"July 2024 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v2-"
"0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller dagliga uppdateringar för norra halvklotet av den "
"motsvarande mängden flytande vatten som lagras i snötäcket. Data finns "
"tillgängliga i nära realtid med en spatial upplösning på 5 km och med "
"tidsomfånget från juli 2024 till nutid. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v2-0"
"-5km)."

msgid ""
"Provides for Europe daily updates of the fraction of snow cover on the "
"ground (also in forested areas) per pixel in percentage (0% – 100%). The "
"data is available in near real time in the spatial resolution of 500 m and "
"with the temporal extent from March 2017 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-europe-"
"v1-0-500m)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller dagliga uppdateringar för Europa av andelen snötäcke på "
"marken (även i skogsområden) per pixel i procent (0 % – 100 %). Data finns "
"tillgängliga i nära realtid med en spatial upplösning på 500 m och med "
"tidsomfånget från mars 2017 till nutid. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-europe-"
"v1-0-500m)."

msgid ""
"Provides for Northern Hemisphere daily maps of the fraction of snow cover "
"on ground (also in forested areas) per pixel in percentage (0% – 100%). The "
"data is available in near real time with a pixel spacing of about 1 km and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2018 to 2026. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-v1-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller dagliga kartor för norra halvklotet över andelen snötäcke "
"på marken (även i skogsområden) per pixel i procent (0 % – 100 %). Data "
"finns tillgängliga i nära realtid med ett pixelavstånd på cirka 1 km och "
"med tidsomfånget från januari 2018 till 2026. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-v1-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Provides for global land areas (excluding Antarctica) daily maps of the "
"fraction of snow cover on ground (also in forested areas) per pixel in "
"percentage (0% – 100%). The data is available in near real time with a "
"pixel spacing of about 1 km and with the temporal extent from December 2025 "
"to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-global-v1-0-1"
"km)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller dagliga kartor för globala landområden (exklusive "
"Antarktis) över andelen snötäcke på marken (även i skogsområden) per pixel "
"i procent (0 % – 100 %). Data finns tillgängliga i nära realtid med ett "
"pixelavstånd på cirka 1 km och med tidsomfånget från december 2025 till "
"nutid. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-global-v1-0-1"
"km)."

msgid ""
"On a daily basis classifies pixels in Northern Hemisphere freshwater bodies "
"into 1) Ice, 2) Open water, and 3) Cloud. The class “Ice” includes various "
"types of ice, also snow-covered ice. The data is updated in near real-time "
"with the spatial resolution of 500 m and with a temporal extent from April "
"2021 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-500m)."
msgstr ""
"Klassificerar dagligen pixlar i sötvattensförekomster på norra halvklotet i "
"1) Is, 2) Öppet vatten och 3) Moln. Klassen \"Is\" omfattar olika typer av "
"is, även snötäckt is. Data uppdateras i nära realtid med en spatial "
"upplösning på 500 m och med ett tidsomfång från april 2021 till 2025. Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-500m)."

msgid ""
"On a daily basis, classifies pixels of Continental Europe freshwater bodies "
"as 1) Fully snow-covered ice, 2) Partially snow-covered or snow-free ice, "
"and 3) Open water. The data is available in near real time in a spatial "
"resolution of 250 m and with the temporal extent from July the 1st, "
"onwards. In June 2024, the data input sensor was transferred from Terra "
"MODIS (VERSION 1.2.1) to NOAA-20 VIIRS (VERSION 2.2.1), and the area was "
"extended from the Baltic region to cover Continental Europe. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"europe-v2-250m)."
msgstr ""
"Klassificerar dagligen pixlar i sötvattensförekomster i kontinentala Europa "
"som 1) Helt snötäckt is, 2) Delvis snötäckt eller snöfri is och 3) Öppet "
"vatten. Data finns tillgängliga i nära realtid med en spatial upplösning på "
"250 m och med tidsomfånget från den 1 juli och framåt. I juni 2024 byttes "
"indatasensorn från Terra MODIS (VERSION 1.2.1) till NOAA-20 VIIRS (VERSION "
"2.2.1), och området utökades från Östersjöregionen till att omfatta "
"kontinentala Europa. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"europe-v2-250m)."

msgid ""
"Detects the areas covered by inland water along the year providing the "
"maximum and the minimum extent of the water surface as well as the seasonal "
"dynamics. Monthly updates are available at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of 100 m and with the temporal extent from 2020 to present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-100m)."
msgstr ""
"Upptäcker områden som täcks av inlandsvatten under året och anger "
"vattenytans maximala och minimala utbredning samt säsongsdynamiken. "
"Månatliga uppdateringar finns tillgängliga i global skala med en spatial "
"upplösning på 100 m och med tidsomfånget från 2020 till nutid. Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-100m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes. 10-daily observations are available in near real time at "
"300 m spatial resolution from September 2024 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-near-real-time-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller halvkontinuerliga observationer för ett stort antal "
"medelstora och stora sjöar. Observationer för vart tionde dygn finns "
"tillgängliga i nära realtid med 300 m spatial upplösning från september "
"2024 till nutid. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-near-real-time-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the "
"temporal extent from 2002 to 2012. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller halvkontinuerliga observationer för ett stort antal "
"medelstora och stora sjöar, enligt Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) eller i övrigt av särskilt intresse för miljöövervakning. "
"Observationer för vart tionde dygn finns tillgängliga med en spatial "
"upplösning på 300 m och med tidsomfånget från 2002 till 2012. Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the "
"temporal extent from 2016 to 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller halvkontinuerliga observationer för ett stort antal "
"medelstora och stora sjöar, enligt Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) eller i övrigt av särskilt intresse för miljöövervakning. "
"Observationer för vart tionde dygn finns tillgängliga med en spatial "
"upplösning på 300 m och med tidsomfånget från 2016 till 2024. Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in near real time in the spatial resolution of "
"100 m and with the temporal extent from 2019 to 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v1-0-100m)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller halvkontinuerliga observationer för ett stort antal "
"medelstora och stora sjöar, enligt Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) eller i övrigt av särskilt intresse för miljöövervakning. "
"Observationer för vart tionde dygn finns tillgängliga i nära realtid med en "
"spatial upplösning på 100 m och med tidsomfånget från 2019 till 2024. Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v1-0-100m)."

msgid ""
"Provides spatial information at global level on different types (classes) "
"of physical coverage of the Earth's surface, e.g. forests, grasslands, "
"croplands, water bodies, wetlands for the base year 2020. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products?tab=full_coverage_land_cover__"
"use)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller spatial information på global nivå om olika typer (klasser) "
"av fysisk täckning av jordytan, t.ex. skog, gräsmark, jordbruksmark, "
"vattenförekomster och våtmarker för basåret 2020. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products?tab=full_coverage_land_cover__"
"use)."

msgid ""
"Provides yearly tree cover density for the pantropical region at 10 m "
"resolution, expressed as percentage of tree cover. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover/"
"tree-cover-density-2020-raster-10-m-pantropical-annual)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller årlig trädtäckningsgrad för den pantropiska regionen med 10 "
"m upplösning, uttryckt som procent trädtäcke. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover/tree-"
"cover-density-2020-raster-10-m-pantropical-annual)."

msgid ""
"On a daily basis classifies pixels in Global freshwater bodies into 1) "
"Snow-covered ice, 2) Partially snow-covered or snow-free ice, 3) Open "
"water, and 4) Cloud. The data is updated in near-real time with the spatial "
"resolution of 500 m and with a temporal extent from July 2025 to present. "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"global-500m_v2)."
msgstr ""
"Klassificerar dagligen pixlar i globala sötvattensförekomster i 1) Snötäckt "
"is, 2) Delvis snötäckt eller snöfri is, 3) Öppet vatten och 4) Moln. Data "
"uppdateras i nära realtid med en spatial upplösning på 500 m och med ett "
"tidsomfång från juli 2025 till nutid. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"global-500m_v2)."

msgid ""
"Provides daily updates on the moisture conditions in different soil layers. "
"The data are available over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from 2007 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-12-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller dagliga uppdateringar av fuktförhållandena i olika "
"jordlager. Data finns tillgängliga över hela jorden med en spatial "
"upplösning på 0,1° och med tidsomfånget från 2007 till nutid. Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-water-"
"index-global-12-5km)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the moisture condition at various depths in the soil. Daily "
"observations are available for the continental Europe in the spatial "
"resolution of 1 km and with the temporal extent from July 2025 to present. "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-europe-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Kvantifierar fuktförhållandena på olika djup i marken. Dagliga "
"observationer finns tillgängliga för kontinentala Europa med en spatial "
"upplösning på 1 km och med tidsomfånget från juli 2025 till nutid. Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-water-"
"index-europe-1km)."

msgid ""
"Averages the daily Soil Water Index product over 10 days. The data are "
"produced every 10 days over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2007 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."
msgstr ""
"Beräknar medelvärdet av den dagliga produkten Soil Water Index över 10 "
"dagar. Data produceras var tionde dag över hela jorden med en spatial "
"upplösning på 0,1° och med tidsomfånget från januari 2007 till nutid. Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."

msgid ""
"On daily basis for the Northern Europe classifies, in pixels, "
"inland/freshwater bodies as 1) Fully snow-covered ice, 2) Partially "
"snow-covered or snow-free ice, 3) Open water. The data is available in near "
"real time in the spatial resolution of 250 m and with the temporal extent "
"from March 2017 to 30 June 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"baltic-v1-250m)."
msgstr ""
"Klassificerar dagligen, per pixel, insjöar och sötvattensförekomster i "
"norra Europa som 1) Helt snötäckt is, 2) Delvis snötäckt eller snöfri is, "
"3) Öppet vatten. Data finns tillgängliga i nära realtid med en spatial "
"upplösning på 250 m och med tidsomfånget från mars 2017 till 30 juni 2024. "
"Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"baltic-v1-250m)."

msgid ""
"Provides actual evapotranspiration, soil evaporation and canopy "
"transpiration with some quality indicators. Estimates are provided for two "
"evapotranspiration schemes and an Ensemble of models. Every 10-days "
"estimate are available in near real time at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of about 300 m from November 2025 onwards in version 1.0. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/"
"evapotranspiration-2025-present-raster-300m-global-10-daily-version-1)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller faktisk evapotranspiration, markevaporation och krontakets "
"transpiration med vissa kvalitetsindikatorer. Skattningar tillhandahålls "
"för två evapotranspirationsscheman och en ensemble av modeller. Skattningar "
"för vart tionde dygn finns tillgängliga i nära realtid i global skala med "
"en spatial upplösning på cirka 300 m från november 2025 och framåt i "
"version 1.0. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/"
"evapotranspiration-2025-present-raster-300m-global-10-daily-version-1)."

msgid ""
"Provides latent and sensible heat fluxes with one auxiliary information. "
"Estimates are provided for each Sentinel-3 overpass in near real time at "
"global scale in the spatial resolution of about 300 m from November 2025 "
"onwards in version 1.0. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/heat-flux-2"
"025-present-raster-300-m-global-daily-version-1)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller latenta och kännbara värmeflöden med ett kompletterande "
"informationslager. Skattningar tillhandahålls för varje överflygning av "
"Sentinel-3 i nära realtid i global skala med en spatial upplösning på cirka "
"300 m från november 2025 och framåt i version 1.0. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/heat-flux-20"
"25-present-raster-300-m-global-daily-version-1)."

msgid ""
"Provides the temperature of the water at the lake surface. The LSWT "
"observations (every 10 days) are available at global scale at spatial "
"resolution of ~1 km and with the temporal extent from 2002 to 2012. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-offline-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller vattentemperaturen vid sjöytan. LSWT-observationerna (var "
"tionde dag) finns tillgängliga i global skala med en spatial upplösning på "
"~1 km och med tidsomfånget från 2002 till 2012. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-offline-1km)."

msgid ""
"Provides the temperature of the water at the lake surface. The near real "
"time observations (every 10 days) are available at global scale at spatial "
"resolution of ~1 km and with the temporal extent from 2016 to present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-near-real-time-v1-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller vattentemperaturen vid sjöytan. Observationerna i nära "
"realtid (var tionde dag) finns tillgängliga i global skala med en spatial "
"upplösning på ~1 km och med tidsomfånget från 2016 till nutid. Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-near-real-time-v1-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in near real time at 100 m spatial resolution "
"from September 2024 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v2-0-100m)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller halvkontinuerliga observationer för ett stort antal "
"medelstora och stora sjöar, enligt Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) eller i övrigt av särskilt intresse för miljöövervakning. "
"Observationer för vart tionde dygn finns tillgängliga i nära realtid med "
"100 m spatial upplösning från september 2024 till nutid. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v2-0-100m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about Leaf Area Index, defined as half the total area "
"of green elements of the canopy per unit horizontal ground area. Every "
"10-days estimates are available at global scale in the spatial resolution "
"of ~300 m from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-v2-"
"0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller information om bladareaindex, definierat som hälften av den "
"totala arean av gröna delar av krontaket per enhet horisontell markyta. "
"Skattningar för vart tionde dygn finns tillgängliga i global skala med en "
"spatial upplösning på ~300 m från januari 2014 till nutid. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-v2-0"
"-300m)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the fraction of the solar radiation absorbed by live plants for "
"photosynthesis. Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale, in "
"the spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-"
"absorbed-photosynthetically-active-radiation-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Kvantifierar andelen solstrålning som absorberas av levande växter för "
"fotosyntes. Skattningar för vart tionde dygn finns tillgängliga i global "
"skala, med en spatial upplösning på ~300 m, från januari 2014 till nutid. "
"Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-"
"absorbed-photosynthetically-active-radiation-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information of the fraction of ground covered by green vegetation. "
"Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of ~ 300 m from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-green-"
"vegetation-cover-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller information om andelen mark som täcks av grön vegetation. "
"Skattningar för vart tionde dygn finns tillgängliga i global skala med en "
"spatial upplösning på ~300 m från januari 2014 till nutid. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-green-"
"vegetation-cover-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2018 provides reliable, "
"inter-comparable, high-resolution land use and land cover data for 764 "
"Functional Urban Areas (FUA) with more than 50,000 inhabitants for the 2018 "
"reference year in EEA38 countries (EU, EFTA, Western Balkans countries, as "
"well as Türkiye) and the United Kingdom. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2018 tillhandahåller tillförlitliga, "
"jämförbara marktäcke- och markanvändningsdata med hög upplösning för 764 "
"funktionella stadsområden (FUA) med fler än 50 000 invånare för "
"referensåret 2018 i EEA38-länderna (EU, Efta, länderna på västra Balkan "
"samt Türkiye) och Storbritannien. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2021 provides reliable, "
"inter-comparable, high-resolution land use and land cover data for 790 "
"Functional Urban Areas (FUA) with more than 50,000 inhabitants for the 2021 "
"reference year in EEA38 countries (EU, EFTA, Western Balkans countries, as "
"well as Türkiye) and the United Kingdom. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2021 tillhandahåller tillförlitliga, "
"jämförbara marktäcke- och markanvändningsdata med hög upplösning för 790 "
"funktionella stadsområden (FUA) med fler än 50 000 invånare för "
"referensåret 2021 i EEA38-länderna (EU, Efta, länderna på västra Balkan "
"samt Türkiye) och Storbritannien. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use Change 2018-2021 provides reliable, "
"inter-comparable, high-resolution land use and land cover change data for "
"764 Functional Urban Areas (FUA) with more than 50,000 inhabitants for the "
"2021 reference year in EEA38 countries (EU, EFTA, Western Balkans "
"countries, as well as Türkiye) and the United Kingdom. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use Change 2018-2021 tillhandahåller "
"tillförlitliga, jämförbara data om förändringar i marktäcke och "
"markanvändning med hög upplösning för 764 funktionella stadsområden (FUA) "
"med fler än 50 000 invånare för referensåret 2021 i EEA38-länderna (EU, "
"Efta, länderna på västra Balkan samt Türkiye) och Storbritannien. Mer "
"information [här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Street Tree Layer 2021 provides information about presence of "
"trees within Functional Urban Areas (FUA). More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Street Tree Layer 2021 tillhandahåller information om förekomst "
"av träd inom funktionella stadsområden (FUA). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Provides detailed land cover and land use information for 59 thematic "
"classes in selected Natura2000 and Emerald sites for the 2021 reference "
"year. The dataset has a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.5 ha and a Minimum "
"Mapping Width (MMW) of 10 m and is available as vector data. More "
"information [here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/n2k)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller detaljerad information om marktäcke och markanvändning för "
"59 tematiska klasser i utvalda Natura 2000- och Emerald-områden för "
"referensåret 2021. Datasetet har en minsta karteringsenhet (MMU) på 0,5 ha "
"och en minsta karteringsbredd (MMW) på 10 m och finns som vektordata. Mer "
"information [här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/n2k)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the overall growth rate, or net dry biomass "
"increase, of the vegetation. It is equivalent to Net Primary Production "
"(NPP) but expressed in kg of dry matter per hectare and per day. Every "
"10-days, estimates are available at global scale, at a spatial resolution "
"of ~300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller information om vegetationens totala tillväxttakt, eller "
"nettoökning av torr biomassa. Den motsvarar nettoprimärproduktion (NPP) men "
"uttrycks i kg torrsubstans per hektar och dag. Skattningar för vart tionde "
"dygn finns tillgängliga i global skala, med en spatial upplösning på ~300 "
"m, från januari 2014 till nutid. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the total amount of carbon compounds produced by "
"photosynthesis of plants in an ecosystem in a given period of time, "
"expressed in gC/m²/day. Every 10-days, estimates are available at global "
"scale, at a spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the "
"present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller information om den totala mängden kolföreningar som "
"produceras genom växternas fotosyntes i ett ekosystem under en given "
"tidsperiod, uttryckt i gC/m²/dag. Skattningar för vart tionde dygn finns "
"tillgängliga i global skala, med en spatial upplösning på ~300 m, från "
"januari 2014 till nutid. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the net amount of biomass, or carbon, produced "
"by plants per unit area and time, expressed in gC/m²/day. It is equal to "
"the difference between the Gross Primary Production (GPP), i.e. the total "
"amount of carbon produced through photosynthesis, and the amount of energy "
"used for plant respiration. Every 10-days, estimates are available at "
"global scale, at a spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the "
"present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller information om nettomängden biomassa, eller kol, som "
"produceras av växter per ytenhet och tid, uttryckt i gC/m²/dag. Den "
"motsvarar skillnaden mellan bruttoprimärproduktionen (GPP), dvs. den totala "
"mängden kol som produceras genom fotosyntes, och den energimängd som "
"används för växternas respiration. Skattningar för vart tionde dygn finns "
"tillgängliga i global skala, med en spatial upplösning på ~300 m, från "
"januari 2014 till nutid. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the total amount of dry matter produced by land "
"plants per unit time through photosynthesis. It is equivalent to Gross "
"Primary Production (GPP) but expressed in kg of dry matter per hectare and "
"per day. Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale, at a "
"spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller information om den totala mängden torrsubstans som "
"produceras av landväxter per tidsenhet genom fotosyntes. Den motsvarar "
"bruttoprimärproduktion (GPP) men uttrycks i kg torrsubstans per hektar och "
"dag. Skattningar för vart tionde dygn finns tillgängliga i global skala, "
"med en spatial upplösning på ~300 m, från januari 2014 till nutid. Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Dominant Leaf Type (DLT) raster product provides a "
"basic land cover classification with 3 thematic classes (all non-tree "
"covered areas, broadleaved and coniferous).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for "
"the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)"
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Dominant Leaf Type (DLT) tillhandahåller en "
"grundläggande marktäckeklassificering med 3 tematiska klasser (alla områden "
"utan trädtäcke, lövträd och barrträd).\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2018 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest ingår i Europeiska "
"unionens Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns "
"tillgängligt för datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land Presence (CPFLP) "
"raster product provides the yearly fallow land classification indicating if "
"arable land has been left fallow in the respective calendar year. This "
"dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries. High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the "
"European Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer "
"available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land "
"Presence (CPFLP) tillhandahåller den årliga klassificeringen av träda och "
"anger om åkermark har lämnats i träda under respektive kalenderår. Detta "
"dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster (helt "
"förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna. Produkten High Resolution Layer Croplands ingår i "
"Europeiska unionens Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager "
"finns tillgängligt för datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil After (CPBSA) "
"raster product provides bare soil period (in days) after the harvest of the "
"main annual crop. Note that the bare soil period cannot transcend the "
"calendar year for which the product is generated.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil After "
"(CPBSA) tillhandahåller perioden med bar jord (i dagar) efter skörden av "
"den huvudsakliga ettåriga grödan. Observera att perioden med bar jord inte "
"kan sträcka sig över det kalenderår som produkten genereras för.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Croplands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns tillgängligt för "
"datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land Duration (CPFLD) "
"raster product provides information on the duration of fallow land periods, "
"expressed in days, over a five-year period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"Note: each product covers a five-year window and is referenced by the end "
"year of that window (e.g. the 2021 product covers the period 2017–2021).\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land "
"Duration (CPFLD) tillhandahåller information om trädaperiodernas längd, "
"uttryckt i dagar, under en femårsperiod.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Obs: varje produkt täcker ett femårsfönster och refereras till med "
"fönstrets slutår (t.ex. täcker produkten för 2021 perioden 2017–2021).\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Croplands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns tillgängligt för "
"datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil Before (CPBSB) "
"raster product provides the bare soil period (in days) before the emergence "
"of the main annual crop. Note that the bare soil period cannot transcend "
"the calendar year for which the product is generated.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil Before "
"(CPBSB) tillhandahåller perioden med bar jord (i dagar) före uppkomsten av "
"den huvudsakliga ettåriga grödan. Observera att perioden med bar jord inte "
"kan sträcka sig över det kalenderår som produkten genereras för.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Croplands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns tillgängligt för "
"datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Dominant Leaf Type Change (DLTC) raster provides "
"information on the change between two reference years, and consists of 5 "
"thematic classes (new broadleaved cover / new coniferous cover / loss of "
"broadleaved cover / loss of coniferous cover / unchanged areas with tree "
"cover). This dataset covers two comparison periods, 2018-2021 and "
"2021-2024, with each product dated by the end year of its comparison "
"period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided in 20 meter rasters (fully conformant with the EEA "
"reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"The production of the high resolution forest layers was coordinated by the "
"European Environment Agency (EEA) in the frame of the EU Copernicus "
"programme.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Rastret High Resolution Layer Dominant Leaf Type Change (DLTC) "
"tillhandahåller information om förändringen mellan två referensår och "
"består av 5 tematiska klasser (nytt lövträdstäcke / nytt barrträdstäcke / "
"förlust av lövträdstäcke / förlust av barrträdstäcke / oförändrade områden "
"med trädtäcke). Detta dataset omfattar två jämförelseperioder, 2018–2021 "
"och 2021–2024, där varje produkt dateras med slutåret för sin "
"jämförelseperiod.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls som 20 meters raster (helt förenliga med EEA:s "
"referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Framställningen av de högupplösta skogslagren samordnades av Europeiska "
"miljöbyrån (EEA) inom ramen för EU:s Copernicus-program.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Crop Types (CTY) raster product provides high "
"resolution crop type classification for 17 classes of both arable and "
"permanent crops across the EEA38 extent. Using both Sentinel-1 and "
"Sentinel-2, the model is finetuned to first map the crop field boundaries, "
"and then determine the main crop for each field.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Crop Types (CTY) tillhandahåller en "
"högupplöst klassificering av grödtyper för 17 klasser av både ettåriga och "
"fleråriga grödor inom hela EEA38-området. Med hjälp av både Sentinel-1 och "
"Sentinel-2 finjusteras modellen för att först kartlägga åkrarnas gränser "
"och sedan fastställa huvudgrödan för varje åker.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Croplands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns tillgängligt för "
"datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Duration (CPMCD) "
"raster product provides the duration (in days) of the growing season for "
"the main (annual) crop.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries. High Resolution Layer Croplands product is "
"part of the European Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence "
"layer available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop "
"Duration (CPMCD) tillhandahåller växtsäsongens längd (i dagar) för "
"huvudgrödan (den ettåriga grödan).\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna. Produkten High Resolution Layer Croplands ingår i "
"Europeiska unionens Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager "
"finns tillgängligt för datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The Copernicus High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Presence Change (TCPC) "
"raster product provides information on the change between two reference "
"years, and consists of 3 thematic classes (new tree cover / loss of tree "
"cover / unchanged areas with tree cover). The class 255 = outside area is "
"predefined by the 100m boundary layer and remains unchanged. This layer for "
"previous reference year comparisons is called Tree Cover Change Mask "
"(TCCM). This dataset covers two comparison periods, 2018-2021 and "
"2021-2024, with each product dated by the end year of its comparison "
"period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided in 20 meter rasters (fully conformant with the EEA "
"reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"The production of the high resolution forest layers was coordinated by the "
"European Environment Agency (EEA) in the frame of the EU Copernicus "
"programme. Confidence layer available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten Copernicus High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Presence Change "
"(TCPC) tillhandahåller information om förändringen mellan två referensår "
"och består av 3 tematiska klasser (nytt trädtäcke / förlust av trädtäcke / "
"oförändrade områden med trädtäcke). Klassen 255 = utanför området är "
"fördefinierad av gränslagret på 100 m och förblir oförändrad. Detta lager "
"för jämförelser av tidigare referensår kallas Tree Cover Change Mask "
"(TCCM). Detta dataset omfattar två jämförelseperioder, 2018–2021 och "
"2021–2024, där varje produkt dateras med slutåret för sin jämförelseperiod.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls som 20 meters raster (helt förenliga med EEA:s "
"referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Framställningen av de högupplösta skogslagren samordnades av Europeiska "
"miljöbyrån (EEA) inom ramen för EU:s Copernicus-program. Konfidenslager "
"finns tillgängligt för datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Change (GRAC) raster product at 20m "
"resolution provides information on changes in grassland vegetation cover. "
"The thematic classes indicate all non-grassland areas, grassland gain and "
"grassland loss, unchanged grassland in both years and unverified grassland "
"gain and loss areas. This dataset covers two comparison periods, 2018-2021 "
"and 2021-2024, with each product dated by the end year of its comparison "
"period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided in 20 meter rasters (fully conformant with the EEA "
"reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Grassland Change (GRAC) med 20 m "
"upplösning tillhandahåller information om förändringar i gräsmarkens "
"vegetationstäcke. De tematiska klasserna anger alla områden som inte är "
"gräsmark, ökning och förlust av gräsmark, gräsmark som är oförändrad båda "
"åren samt overifierade områden med ökning och förlust av gräsmark. Detta "
"dataset omfattar två jämförelseperioder, 2018–2021 och 2021–2024, där varje "
"produkt dateras med slutåret för sin jämförelseperiod.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls som 20 meters raster (helt förenliga med EEA:s "
"referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Grasslands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns tillgängligt för "
"datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) provides a forest "
"classification with 3 thematic classes (all non-forest areas / broadleaved "
"forest / coniferous forest) at 10m spatial resolution and with a Minimum "
"Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.5 ha. This raster layer is largely following the "
"FAO (Food and Agriculture Organisation of the United Nations) forest "
"definition with tree covered areas in agricultural and urban context "
"excluded using the respective Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)"
msgstr ""
"High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) tillhandahåller en "
"skogsklassificering med 3 tematiska klasser (alla områden utan skog / "
"lövskog / barrskog) med 10 m spatial upplösning och med en minsta "
"karteringsenhet (MMU) på 0,5 ha. Detta rasterlager följer i stort FAO:s "
"(FN:s livsmedels- och jordbruksorganisation) skogsdefinition, där "
"trädbevuxna områden i jordbruks- och stadsmiljö har uteslutits med hjälp av "
"respektive Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL).\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls var tredje år som 10 meters raster (helt "
"förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest ingår i Europeiska "
"unionens Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) raster product provides a binary "
"status layer of grassland/non-grassland mask. This grassy and non-woody "
"vegetation baseline product includes all kinds of grasslands: managed "
"grassland, semi-natural grassland and natural grassy vegetation. It does "
"not include temporary grasslands, which are masked out using the "
"corresponding Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH), indicating on the number of "
"years since a pixel was last ploughed.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) tillhandahåller ett "
"binärt statuslager med mask för gräsmark/icke-gräsmark. Denna basprodukt "
"för gräsbevuxen och icke-vedartad vegetation omfattar alla typer av "
"gräsmark: skött gräsmark, seminaturlig gräsmark och naturlig gräsbevuxen "
"vegetation. Den omfattar inte tillfälliga gräsmarker, som maskas bort med "
"hjälp av motsvarande plöjningsindikator (PLOUGH), som anger antalet år "
"sedan en pixel senast plöjdes.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Grasslands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns tillgängligt för "
"datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) dataset provides "
"information on the proportional crown coverage per pixel at 10 meter "
"spatial resolution and ranges from 0% (all non-tree covered areas) to 100%, "
"whereby Tree Cover Density is defined as the \"vertical projection of tree "
"crowns to a horizontal earth’s surface\".\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for "
"the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)."
msgstr ""
"Datasetet High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) tillhandahåller "
"information om andelen kronytetäckning per pixel med 10 meters spatial "
"upplösning, från 0 % (alla områden utan trädtäcke) till 100 %, där "
"trädtäckningsgrad definieras som \"den vertikala projektionen av trädkronor "
"på en horisontell jordyta\".\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2018 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest ingår i Europeiska "
"unionens Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns "
"tillgängligt för datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH) raster product "
"continues the 2015 and 2018 PLOUGH Layer following a rolling archive "
"principle by adding current information and removing historic years. It "
"indicates the number of years since the last indication of ploughing within "
"the permanent grassland area. PLOUGH is derived by taking into account the "
"series of binary HER layers, the BVL classifications and HR VPP PPI (Plant "
"Phenology Index) quantiles. BVL classes 4 (crop) and 7 (overlaying layer "
"between herbaceous and crop) indicate a ploughing event. Low HR VPP PPI "
"quantiles indicate low vegetation at a certain time of the year. For years "
"with missing information (2016 and earlier) the ploughing information from "
"the historic PLOUGH product is considered which causes some issues.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH) "
"fortsätter PLOUGH-lagren för 2015 och 2018 enligt en rullande arkivprincip "
"genom att lägga till aktuell information och ta bort historiska år. Den "
"anger antalet år sedan den senaste indikationen på plöjning inom området "
"med permanent gräsmark. PLOUGH härleds genom att ta hänsyn till serien av "
"binära HER-lager, BVL-klassificeringarna och kvantilerna för HR VPP PPI "
"(Plant Phenology Index). BVL-klasserna 4 (gröda) och 7 (överlappande lager "
"mellan örtartad vegetation och gröda) anger en plöjningshändelse. Låga "
"kvantiler för HR VPP PPI anger låg vegetation vid en viss tid på året. För "
"år med saknad information (2016 och tidigare) beaktas "
"plöjningsinformationen från den historiska PLOUGH-produkten, vilket orsakar "
"vissa problem.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Grasslands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Building Block Height 2021 is a 10 m high resolution raster "
"layer containing height information generated for selected cities and urban "
"areas as part of the Urban atlas suite of products. Height information is "
"based on satellite information and derived datasets like the digital "
"surface model, the digital terrain model and the normalized digital surface "
"model (DSM). More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Building Block Height 2021 är ett högupplöst rasterlager på 10 "
"m som innehåller höjdinformation som genererats för utvalda städer och "
"tätorter som en del av produktsviten Urban Atlas. Höjdinformationen bygger "
"på satellitinformation och härledda dataset som digital ytmodell, digital "
"terrängmodell och normaliserad digital ytmodell (DSM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Type (CPSCT) "
"raster product indicates if a cover crop was present within the respective "
"calendar year and further segregates the types of cover crop into: short "
"summer, long summer, short winter and long winter cover crop.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop "
"Type (CPSCT) anger om en täckgröda fanns under respektive kalenderår och "
"delar vidare in täckgrödorna i: kort sommartäckgröda, lång sommartäckgröda, "
"kort vintertäckgröda och lång vintertäckgröda.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Croplands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns tillgängligt för "
"datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Dates (GRAMD) raster product "
"provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 10 m a basic "
"land cover classification, flagging and mapping the start date (DOY) "
"(GRAMD) within the detected Herbaceous cover layer (temporal and permanent "
"grassland)) with a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.25 ha. The GRAMD product "
"will flag and map the dates (Day of Year) of each mowing event on temporary "
"or permanent grassland per year, resulting in a product split in four "
"different rasters per year.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2017 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Dates (GRAMD) "
"tillhandahåller på paneuropeisk nivå, med 10 m spatial upplösning, en "
"grundläggande marktäckeklassificering som flaggar och kartlägger startdatum "
"(DOY) (GRAMD) inom det detekterade lagret med örtartat täcke (tillfällig "
"och permanent gräsmark) med en minsta karteringsenhet (MMU) på 0,25 ha. "
"Produkten GRAMD flaggar och kartlägger datumen (dag på året) för varje "
"slåtter på tillfällig eller permanent gräsmark per år, vilket resulterar i "
"en produkt som delas upp i fyra olika raster per år.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Grasslands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons Types "
"(CPCSY) raster product provides the number of different crop types grown in "
"a 3-year period [0-3] (excluding cover crops).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons "
"Types (CPCSY) tillhandahåller antalet olika grödtyper som odlats under en "
"treårsperiod [0–3] (exklusive täckgrödor).\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Croplands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Events (GRAME) raster product "
"provides a basic land cover classification containing respectively the "
"number of grassland mowing events within the detected Herbaceous cover "
"layer (temporal and permanent grassland) with a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) "
"of 0.25 ha. The GRAME product will flag and map the number of mowing events "
"(1, 2, 3, or 4+) on temporary or permanent grassland detected per year.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Events (GRAME) "
"tillhandahåller en grundläggande marktäckeklassificering som innehåller "
"antalet slåtter på gräsmark inom det detekterade lagret med örtartat täcke "
"(tillfällig och permanent gräsmark) med en minsta karteringsenhet (MMU) på "
"0,25 ha. Produkten GRAME flaggar och kartlägger antalet slåtter (1, 2, 3 "
"eller 4+) på tillfällig eller permanent gräsmark som upptäckts per år.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Grasslands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns tillgängligt för "
"datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Herbaceous cover (HER) raster product provides a "
"basic land cover classification with 2 thematic classes (temporal and "
"permanent herbaceous / non-herbaceous). The production of the herbaceous "
"layer is primarily based on the probability estimates obtained from the "
"Base Vegetation Layer (BVL) which also serves to harmonize the different "
"vegetated HRL products (Grasslands, Tree Cover and Forests, Croplands). HER "
"is further used as input for the Grassland status layer (GRA) extracting "
"the permanent herbaceous in combination with the Ploughing indicator "
"(PLOUGH).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Herbaceous cover (HER) "
"tillhandahåller en grundläggande marktäckeklassificering med 2 tematiska "
"klasser (tillfälligt och permanent örtartat / icke örtartat). "
"Framställningen av lagret för örtartat täcke bygger främst på "
"sannolikhetsskattningarna från Base Vegetation Layer (BVL), som också "
"används för att harmonisera de olika HRL-produkterna för vegetation "
"(Grasslands, Tree Cover and Forests, Croplands). HER används vidare som "
"indata för statuslagret för gräsmark (GRA), där det permanenta örtartade "
"täcket extraheras i kombination med plöjningsindikatorn (PLOUGH).\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Grasslands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons Yearly "
"(CPCSY) raster product provides number of growing seasons detected within 1 "
"year (0/1/2).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons "
"Yearly (CPCSY) tillhandahåller antalet växtsäsonger som upptäckts under ett "
"år (0/1/2).\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Croplands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-synthesis-global-v3-0-3km)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller skattningar av landytetemperatur i global skala, med en "
"spatial upplösning på ~3 km. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-synthesis-global-v3-0-3km)."

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-global-v3-0-3km)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller skattningar av landytetemperatur i global skala, med en "
"spatial upplösning på ~3 km. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-global-v3-0-3km)."

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-"
"reflectance?tab=land_surface_temperature)."
msgstr ""
"Tillhandahåller skattningar av landytetemperatur i global skala, med en "
"spatial upplösning på ~3 km. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-"
"reflectance?tab=land_surface_temperature)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Emergence "
"(CPSCE) raster product provides the date of emergence of the cover crop in "
"days of the year (DOY). YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the year (e.g. 19 "
"for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365)\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop "
"Emergence (CPSCE) tillhandahåller datumet för täckgrödans uppkomst i dag på "
"året (DOY). ÅÅDOY där ÅÅ = de två sista siffrorna i året (t.ex. 19 för "
"2019) och DOY är dag på året (1–365)\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Croplands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns tillgängligt för "
"datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) provides "
"information on trees under agricultural use or in urban context to be "
"excluded from the Forest Type (FTY) product and at 10m spatial resolution. "
"The derivation of Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) is based on the "
"spatial intersection of the 10m DLT and TCD layers with CORINE Land Cover "
"(CLC) 2018 and HRL Imperviousness Degree 2018 with 10 m spatial resolution; "
"TCD range of 10-100%; with a MMW of 10m and no MMU (pixel base).\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries.\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"High Resolution Layer Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) "
"tillhandahåller information om träd i jordbruksanvändning eller i "
"stadsmiljö som ska uteslutas från produkten Forest Type (FTY), med 10 m "
"spatial upplösning. Framställningen av Forest Additional Support Layer "
"(FADSL) bygger på den spatiala skärningen mellan 10 m-lagren DLT och TCD "
"och CORINE Land Cover (CLC) 2018 samt HRL Imperviousness Degree 2018 med 10 "
"m spatial upplösning; TCD-intervall på 10–100 %; med en MMW på 10 m och "
"ingen MMU (pixelbaserat).\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls var tredje år som 10 meters raster (helt "
"förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest ingår i Europeiska "
"unionens Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Duration "
"(CPSCD) raster product provides the duration (in days) of the cover crop "
"season (can exceed the calendar year).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop "
"Duration (CPSCD) tillhandahåller längden (i dagar) på täckgrödans säsong "
"(kan sträcka sig över kalenderåret).\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Croplands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns tillgängligt för "
"datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The Cloud Classification (CC) product provides information on the extent of "
"clouds and cloud shadows derived from optical satellite data acquired by "
"the **Sentinel-2** constellation. Cloud detection is performed at a "
"**120m** spatial resolution using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale, with a pixel spacing of 20 m "
"x 20 m. It used to produce the CLMS High-Resolution Water, Snow and Ice "
"datasets (HR-WSI), which rely on Sentinel-2 imagery.<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present. No product is generated for a "
"Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds 90%.<br><br>More information in "
"the products documentation "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Produkten Cloud Classification (CC) tillhandahåller information om "
"utbredningen av moln och molnskuggor, härledd från optiska satellitdata som "
"inhämtats av konstellationen **Sentinel-2**. Molndetektering utförs med "
"**120 m** spatial upplösning med hjälp av [programvaran "
"MAJA](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Den genereras i "
"nära realtid i europeisk skala, med ett pixelavstånd på 20 m x 20 m. Den "
"används för att ta fram CLMS High-Resolution Water, Snow and Ice-dataseten "
"(HR-WSI), som bygger på Sentinel-2-bilder.<br><br>**Datatillgänglighet**: "
"från 2016 till nutid. Ingen produkt genereras för en Sentinel-2-tile när "
"molntäcket överstiger 90 %.<br><br>Mer information i produktdokumentationen "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."

msgid ""
"The **Fractional Snow Cover (FSC)** product provides the fraction of the "
"surface covered by snow at the top of canopy (FSC-TOC) and on ground "
"(FSC-OG) per pixel as a percentage (0% – 100%). Cloud detection in the "
"Sentinel-2 imagery is performed using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale based on optical satellite "
"data from the **Sentinel-2** constellation, with a spatial resolution of "
"**20 m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. No "
"product is generated for a Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds "
"90%.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Produkten **Fractional Snow Cover (FSC)** tillhandahåller andelen av ytan "
"som täcks av snö högst upp i trädkronorna (FSC-TOC) och på marken (FSC-OG) "
"per pixel som procent (0 % – 100 %). Molndetektering i Sentinel-2-bilderna "
"utförs med hjälp av [programvaran "
"MAJA](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Den genereras i "
"nära realtid i europeisk skala baserat på optiska satellitdata från "
"konstellationen **Sentinel-2**, med en spatial upplösning på **20 m x 20 "
"m**.<br><br>**Datatillgänglighet**: från 2016 till nutid. Ingen produkt "
"genereras för en Sentinel-2-tile när molntäcket överstiger 90 %.<br><br>Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."

msgid ""
"The **SAR Wet Snow (SWS)** product provides the wet snow extent for high "
"mountain areas, based on C-band Synthetic Aperture Radar satellite data "
"from the **Sentinel-1** constellation.<br><br>It is generated in near "
"real-time for selected high mountain areas at European scale with a spatial "
"resolution of **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to "
"the present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-sar-wet-"
"snow)."
msgstr ""
"Produkten **SAR Wet Snow (SWS)** tillhandahåller utbredningen av blöt snö i "
"högfjällsområden, baserat på satellitdata från C-bands Synthetic Aperture "
"Radar från konstellationen **Sentinel-1**.<br><br>Den genereras i nära "
"realtid för utvalda högfjällsområden i europeisk skala med en spatial "
"upplösning på **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Datatillgänglighet**: från 2016 "
"till nutid.<br><br>Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-sar-wet-"
"snow)."

msgid ""
"The **Wet / Dry Snow (WDS)** product provides information on the snow state "
"(wet or dry) by combining **Sentinel-1** radar-based wet snow maps within "
"the snow cover extent derived from **Sentinel-2** optical data. Cloud "
"detection in the Sentinel-2 imagery is performed using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale, with a spatial resolution of "
"**60 m x 60 m** in areas where Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 observation tracks "
"overlap.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. No product "
"is generated for a Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds "
"90%.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-wet-dry-"
"snow)."
msgstr ""
"Produkten **Wet / Dry Snow (WDS)** tillhandahåller information om snöns "
"tillstånd (blöt eller torr) genom att kombinera radarbaserade kartor över "
"blöt snö från **Sentinel-1** inom den snötäckta utbredning som härletts "
"från optiska data från **Sentinel-2**. Molndetektering i "
"Sentinel-2-bilderna utförs med hjälp av [programvaran "
"MAJA](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Den genereras i "
"nära realtid i europeisk skala, med en spatial upplösning på **60 m x 60 "
"m** i områden där observationsbanorna för Sentinel-1 och Sentinel-2 "
"överlappar.<br><br>**Datatillgänglighet**: från 2016 till nutid. Ingen "
"produkt genereras för en Sentinel-2-tile när molntäcket överstiger 90 "
"%.<br><br>Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-wet-dry-"
"snow)."

msgid ""
"The daily cumulative **Gap-filled Fractional Snow Cover (GFSC)** product "
"provides pixel-wise snow cover extent as a percentage (0% – 100%). It is "
"based on synthetic aperture radar (SAR) data from the **Sentinel-1** "
"constellation and optical imagery from the **Sentinel-2** constellation. "
"The product is generated by merging all available Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 "
"observations acquired over the previous **seven days** to produce a "
"spatially complete composite of snow conditions, thereby reducing data gaps "
"caused by cloud cover and sensor coverage limitations. Snow information "
"derived from Sentinel-1 is focused on the detection of wet snow in "
"high-mountain areas.<br><br>It is generated on a daily basis at European "
"scale, with a spatial resolution of **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-gap-"
"filled-fractional-snow-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Den dagliga kumulativa produkten **Gap-filled Fractional Snow Cover "
"(GFSC)** tillhandahåller snötäckets utbredning per pixel som procent (0 % – "
"100 %). Den bygger på data från Synthetic Aperture Radar (SAR) från "
"konstellationen **Sentinel-1** och optiska bilder från konstellationen "
"**Sentinel-2**. Produkten genereras genom att slå samman alla tillgängliga "
"Sentinel-1- och Sentinel-2-observationer som inhämtats under de föregående "
"**sju dagarna** för att få fram en spatialt komplett komposit av "
"snöförhållandena, vilket minskar datalucker som orsakas av molntäcke och "
"begränsningar i sensorernas täckning. Snöinformation som härleds från "
"Sentinel-1 fokuserar på detektering av blöt snö i "
"högfjällsområden.<br><br>Den genereras dagligen i europeisk skala, med en "
"spatial upplösning på **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Datatillgänglighet**: från "
"2016 till nutid.<br><br>Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-gap-"
"filled-fractional-snow-cover)."

msgid ""
"The Sentinel-2 **Snow Phenology (SP S2)** product characterizes the timing "
"and duration of the snow season. For each pixel and for a given "
"hydrological year, it provides the number of days with snow cover, as well "
"as the first and last day of the longest continuous snow period. The "
"hydrological year starts on 1 September.<br><br>The product is generated at "
"the European scale with a spatial resolution of **20 m x 20 m**, consistent "
"with the input snow cover maps derived from optical satellite data acquired "
"by the Sentinel-2 constellation (Fractional Snow Cover - "
"FSC).<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can "
"be downloaded in multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."
msgstr ""
"Produkten Sentinel-2 **Snow Phenology (SP S2)** beskriver snösäsongens "
"tidpunkt och längd. För varje pixel och för ett givet hydrologiskt år anger "
"den antalet dagar med snötäcke samt första och sista dagen av den längsta "
"sammanhängande snöperioden. Det hydrologiska året börjar den 1 "
"september.<br><br>Produkten genereras i europeisk skala med en spatial "
"upplösning på **20 m x 20 m**, i linje med de snötäckekartor (Fractional "
"Snow Cover - FSC) som används som indata och som härleds från optiska "
"satellitdata som inhämtats av konstellationen "
"Sentinel-2.<br><br>**Datatillgänglighet**: från 2016 till nutid. Data kan "
"laddas ner i flera projektioner och pixelavstånd.<br><br>Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."

msgid ""
"The Sentinel-1 & Sentinel-2 **Snow Phenology (SP S1+S2)** product "
"characterizes the timing and duration of the snow season. For each pixel "
"and for a given hydrological year, it provides the number of days with snow "
"cover, as well as the first and last day of the longest continuous snow "
"period. The hydrological year starts on 1 September.<br><br>The product is "
"generated at the European scale with a spatial resolution of **60 m x 60 "
"m**, consistent with the input snow cover maps derived from optical "
"satellite data acquired by the Sentinel-2 constellation and from C-band "
"Synthetic Aperture Radar satellite data acquired by the Sentinel-1 "
"constellation (Gap-filled Fractional Snow Cover - GFSC).<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can be downloaded in "
"multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."
msgstr ""
"Produkten Sentinel-1 & Sentinel-2 **Snow Phenology (SP S1+S2)** beskriver "
"snösäsongens tidpunkt och längd. För varje pixel och för ett givet "
"hydrologiskt år anger den antalet dagar med snötäcke samt första och sista "
"dagen av den längsta sammanhängande snöperioden. Det hydrologiska året "
"börjar den 1 september.<br><br>Produkten genereras i europeisk skala med en "
"spatial upplösning på **60 m x 60 m**, i linje med de snötäckekartor "
"(Gap-filled Fractional Snow Cover - GFSC) som används som indata och som "
"härleds från optiska satellitdata som inhämtats av konstellationen "
"Sentinel-2 och från satellitdata från C-bands Synthetic Aperture Radar som "
"inhämtats av konstellationen Sentinel-1.<br><br>**Datatillgänglighet**: "
"från 2016 till nutid. Data kan laddas ner i flera projektioner och "
"pixelavstånd.<br><br>Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."

msgid ""
"The **Water Cover Duration (WCD)** product estimates the number of days "
"land is covered by water. For each pixel and for a given hydrological year, "
"it indicates how frequently water is present. The hydrological year starts "
"on 1 September. It is based on water masks derived from **Sentinel-1** "
"radar and **Sentinel-2** optical data, combined with Water/Ice Cover data "
"from Sentinel-2 (WIC S2).<br><br>The product is generated at the European "
"scale with a spatial resolution of **10 m x 10 m**.<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can be downloaded in "
"multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-cover-duration)."
msgstr ""
"Produkten **Water Cover Duration (WCD)** uppskattar antalet dagar som mark "
"är täckt av vatten. För varje pixel och för ett givet hydrologiskt år anger "
"den hur ofta vatten förekommer. Det hydrologiska året börjar den 1 "
"september. Den bygger på vattenmasker som härleds från radardata från "
"**Sentinel-1** och optiska data från **Sentinel-2**, i kombination med data "
"om vatten-/istäcke från Sentinel-2 (WIC S2).<br><br>Produkten genereras i "
"europeisk skala med en spatial upplösning på **10 m x 10 "
"m**.<br><br>**Datatillgänglighet**: från 2016 till nutid. Data kan laddas "
"ner i flera projektioner och pixelavstånd.<br><br>Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-cover-duration)."

msgid ""
"The **Ice Cover Duration (ICD)** product describes how long inland waters "
"are covered by ice. For each pixel and for a given hydrological year, it "
"provides the number of days with ice cover. The hydrological year starts on "
"1 September. It is based on ice cover maps derived from **Sentinel-2** "
"optical data (Water/Ice Cover WIC S2) and **Sentinel-1** C-band Synthetic "
"Aperture Radar data (Water/Ice Cover WIC S1).<br><br>The product is "
"generated at the European scale with a spatial resolution of **20 m x 20 "
"m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can "
"be downloaded in multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"ice-cover-duration)."
msgstr ""
"Produkten **Ice Cover Duration (ICD)** beskriver hur länge inlandsvatten är "
"täckta av is. För varje pixel och för ett givet hydrologiskt år anger den "
"antalet dagar med istäcke. Det hydrologiska året börjar den 1 september. "
"Den bygger på istäckekartor som härleds från optiska data från "
"**Sentinel-2** (Water/Ice Cover WIC S2) och C-bands Synthetic Aperture "
"Radar-data från **Sentinel-1** (Water/Ice Cover WIC S1).<br><br>Produkten "
"genereras i europeisk skala med en spatial upplösning på **20 m x 20 "
"m**.<br><br>**Datatillgänglighet**: från 2016 till nutid. Data kan laddas "
"ner i flera projektioner och pixelavstånd.<br><br>Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"ice-cover-duration)."

msgid ""
"The **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 (WICS1)** product provides "
"information about river and lake areas covered by snow-covered or snow-free "
"ice. It is based on synthetic aperture radar data from the **Sentinel-1** "
"constellation.<br><br>It is generated in near real-time at European scale, "
"with a spatial resolution of **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: "
"from 2016 to the present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."
msgstr ""
"Produkten **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 (WICS1)** tillhandahåller "
"information om flod- och sjöområden som täcks av snötäckt eller snöfri is. "
"Den bygger på Synthetic Aperture Radar-data från konstellationen "
"**Sentinel-1**.<br><br>Den genereras i nära realtid i europeisk skala, med "
"en spatial upplösning på **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Datatillgänglighet**: "
"från 2016 till nutid.<br><br>Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."

msgid ""
"The **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-2 (WICS2)** product provides the "
"water and ice extent over land. A water mask is used to differentiate "
"between snow on ice-covered water areas and snow on land. Cloud detection "
"in the Sentinel-2 imagery is performed using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale based on optical satellite "
"data from the Sentinel-2 constellation, with a spatial resolution of **20 m "
"x 20 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. No "
"product is generated for a Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds "
"90%.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."
msgstr ""
"Produkten **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-2 (WICS2)** tillhandahåller "
"utbredningen av vatten och is över land. En vattenmask används för att "
"skilja mellan snö på istäckta vattenområden och snö på land. "
"Molndetektering i Sentinel-2-bilderna utförs med hjälp av [programvaran "
"MAJA](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Den genereras i "
"nära realtid i europeisk skala baserat på optiska satellitdata från "
"konstellationen Sentinel-2, med en spatial upplösning på **20 m x 20 "
"m**.<br><br>**Datatillgänglighet**: från 2016 till nutid. Ingen produkt "
"genereras för en Sentinel-2-tile när molntäcket överstiger 90 %.<br><br>Mer "
"information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."

msgid ""
"The **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 (WIC S1+S2)** "
"product shows which river and lake areas are covered by ice, with or "
"without snow. It combines data from two types of instruments acquired on "
"the same day to increase coverage and reduce missing information. It uses "
"water/ice cover information derived from **Sentinel-2** optical images (WIC "
"S2), and from **Sentinel-1** radar data (WIC S1).<br><br>The product is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale, with a spatial resolution of "
"**20 m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the "
"present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."
msgstr ""
"Produkten **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 (WIC S1+S2)** "
"visar vilka flod- och sjöområden som täcks av is, med eller utan snö. Den "
"kombinerar data från två typer av instrument som inhämtats samma dag för "
"att öka täckningen och minska saknad information. Den använder information "
"om vatten-/istäcke som härleds från optiska bilder från **Sentinel-2** (WIC "
"S2) och från radardata från **Sentinel-1** (WIC S1).<br><br>Produkten "
"genereras i nära realtid i europeisk skala, med en spatial upplösning på "
"**20 m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Datatillgänglighet**: från 2016 till "
"nutid.<br><br>Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Broadleaved Density (BCD) dataset provides "
"information on the percentage of broadleaved pixels at 100m spatial "
"resolution, and is derived through aggregation of the 10m DLT for the "
"respective reference year. Within each cell the number of broadleaved "
"pixels are counted and the percentages stored into in the 100m pixel of the "
"BCD. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer "
"and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Datasetet High Resolution Layer Broadleaved Density (BCD) tillhandahåller "
"information om andelen lövträdspixlar med 100 m spatial upplösning och "
"härleds genom aggregering av 10 m-lagret DLT för respektive referensår. "
"Inom varje cell räknas antalet lövträdspixlar och procentandelarna lagras i "
"BCD:s 100 m-pixel. Klassen 255 = utanför området är fördefinierad av "
"gränslagret på 100 m och förblir oförändrad.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2018 som 100 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest ingår i Europeiska "
"unionens Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Coniferous Cover Density (CCD) dataset provides "
"information on the percentage of coniferous pixels at 100m spatial "
"resolution, and is derived through aggregation of the 10m DLT for the "
"respective reference year. Within each cell the number of coniferous pixels "
"are counted and the percentages stored into in the 100m pixel of the CCD. "
"The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer and "
"remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Datasetet High Resolution Layer Coniferous Cover Density (CCD) "
"tillhandahåller information om andelen barrträdspixlar med 100 m spatial "
"upplösning och härleds genom aggregering av 10 m-lagret DLT för respektive "
"referensår. Inom varje cell räknas antalet barrträdspixlar och "
"procentandelarna lagras i CCD:s 100 m-pixel. Klassen 255 = utanför området "
"är fördefinierad av gränslagret på 100 m och förblir oförändrad.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2018 som 100 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest ingår i Europeiska "
"unionens Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) dataset provides the Forest "
"Type estimation at 100 meter spatial resolution. The number of broadleaved "
"and coniferous pixels are counted and the percentages stored in the 100m "
"cell. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer "
"and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Datasetet High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) tillhandahåller "
"skattningen av skogstyp med 100 meters spatial upplösning. Antalet "
"lövträds- och barrträdspixlar räknas och procentandelarna lagras i 100 "
"m-cellen. Klassen 255 = utanför området är fördefinierad av gränslagret på "
"100 m och förblir oförändrad.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls var tredje år som 100 meters raster (helt "
"förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest ingår i Europeiska "
"unionens Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) raster product provides a binary "
"status layer of grassland/non-grassland mask. This grassy and non-woody "
"vegetation baseline product includes all kinds of grasslands: managed "
"grassland, semi-natural grassland and natural grassy vegetation. It does "
"not include temporary grasslands, which are masked out using the "
"corresponding Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH), indicating on the number of "
"years since a pixel was last ploughed. In the 100 meter raster product, the "
"number of Grassland pixels are counted and the percentages stored in each "
"100 meter cell. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m "
"boundary layer and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) tillhandahåller ett "
"binärt statuslager med mask för gräsmark/icke-gräsmark. Denna basprodukt "
"för gräsbevuxen och icke-vedartad vegetation omfattar alla typer av "
"gräsmark: skött gräsmark, seminaturlig gräsmark och naturlig gräsbevuxen "
"vegetation. Den omfattar inte tillfälliga gräsmarker, som maskas bort med "
"hjälp av motsvarande plöjningsindikator (PLOUGH), som anger antalet år "
"sedan en pixel senast plöjdes. I rasterprodukten på 100 meter räknas "
"antalet gräsmarkspixlar och procentandelarna lagras i varje 100 m-cell. "
"Klassen 255 = utanför området är fördefinierad av gränslagret på 100 m och "
"förblir oförändrad.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 100 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Grasslands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) dataset provides "
"information on the proportional crown coverage per pixel at 100 meter "
"spatial resolution and ranges from 0% (all non-tree covered areas) to 100%, "
"whereby Tree Cover Density is defined as the \"vertical projection of tree "
"crowns to a horizontal earth's surface\". This product is an aggregation of "
"its corresponding high resolution dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Datasetet High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) tillhandahåller "
"information om andelen kronytetäckning per pixel med 100 meters spatial "
"upplösning, från 0 % (alla områden utan trädtäcke) till 100 %, där "
"trädtäckningsgrad definieras som \"den vertikala projektionen av trädkronor "
"på en horisontell jordyta\". Denna produkt är en aggregering av motsvarande "
"högupplösta dataset.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2018 som 100 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest ingår i Europeiska "
"unionens Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Emergence (CPMCE) "
"raster product provides the emergence date of the main (annual) crop "
"expressed in DOY (day of year). YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the year "
"(e.g. 19 for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop "
"Emergence (CPMCE) tillhandahåller uppkomstdatumet för huvudgrödan (den "
"ettåriga grödan) uttryckt i DOY (dag på året). ÅÅDOY där ÅÅ = de två sista "
"siffrorna i året (t.ex. 19 för 2019) och DOY är dag på året (1–365).\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Croplands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns tillgängligt för "
"datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Harvest (CPMCH) "
"raster product provides the harvest date of the main (annual) crop "
"expressed in days of the year (DOY). The harvest is considered as the time "
"of removal of most of the biomass. YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the "
"year (e.g. 19 for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterprodukten High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Harvest "
"(CPMCH) tillhandahåller skördedatumet för huvudgrödan (den ettåriga grödan) "
"uttryckt i dag på året (DOY). Skörden anses vara tidpunkten då den största "
"delen av biomassan avlägsnas. ÅÅDOY där ÅÅ = de två sista siffrorna i året "
"(t.ex. 19 för 2019) och DOY är dag på året (1–365).\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset tillhandahålls årligen med start 2017 som 10 meters raster "
"(helt förenliga med EEA:s referensrutnät) i 100 x 100 km-tiles som täcker "
"EEA38-länderna.\n"
"\n"
"Produkten High Resolution Layer Croplands ingår i Europeiska unionens "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslager finns tillgängligt för "
"datasetet.\n"
"\n"
"Detta dataset innehåller data från de franska utomeuropeiska departementen "
"(DOM). Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"This metadata refers to the CORINE Land Cover Plus Land Use, Land-Use "
"Change and Forestry Instance (CLCplus LULUCF Instance), an annually "
"updated, pan-European, spatially consistent and seamless geospatial proxy "
"for land use reporting under the LULUCF regulation. The product is "
"delivered as a single raster layer with a spatial resolution of 100 m, "
"derived from multiple pan-European Copernicus Land Monitoring Service "
"(CLMS) high resolution input datasets. The LULUCF Instance is available for "
"the reference years 2018, 2021, 2022 and 2023, with production moving to an "
"annual update cycle starting from the 2021 product. Each raster cell "
"represents a dominant LULUCF land-use class, assigned according to thematic "
"and spatial rulesets implemented during the extraction process. While each "
"pixel corresponds primarily to one of the six main LULUCF land use "
"categories - forest land, grassland, cropland, settlements, wetlands, and "
"other lands - the dataset further differentiates these categories into sub "
"classes, resulting in a total of 27 classes. This classification structure "
"supports greenhouse gas reporting and other applications within the LULUCF "
"sector by providing a harmonised and policy relevant representation of land "
"use across Europe. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/clcplus-lulucf-instance)."
msgstr ""
"Dessa metadata avser CORINE Land Cover Plus Land Use, Land-Use Change and "
"Forestry Instance (CLCplus LULUCF Instance), en årligen uppdaterad, "
"paneuropeisk, spatialt konsekvent och sömlös geospatial proxy för "
"rapportering av markanvändning enligt LULUCF-förordningen. Produkten "
"levereras som ett enda rasterlager med en spatial upplösning på 100 m, "
"härlett från flera paneuropeiska högupplösta indatadataset från Copernicus "
"Land Monitoring Service (CLMS). LULUCF Instance finns tillgänglig för "
"referensåren 2018, 2021, 2022 och 2023, och produktionen går över till en "
"årlig uppdateringscykel från och med produkten för 2021. Varje rastercell "
"representerar en dominerande LULUCF-markanvändningsklass, som tilldelas "
"enligt tematiska och spatiala regelverk som tillämpas under "
"extraktionsprocessen. Även om varje pixel i första hand motsvarar en av de "
"sex huvudsakliga LULUCF-markanvändningskategorierna – skogsmark, gräsmark, "
"åkermark, bebyggelse, våtmarker och övrig mark – delar datasetet vidare in "
"dessa kategorier i underklasser, vilket ger totalt 27 klasser. Denna "
"klassificeringsstruktur stöder rapportering av växthusgaser och andra "
"tillämpningar inom LULUCF-sektorn genom att ge en harmoniserad och "
"policyrelevant bild av markanvändningen i hela Europa. Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/clcplus-lulucf-instance)."

msgid ""
"The **High Resolution Water Layer (HRWL)** product provides classified maps "
"showing permanent water, temporary water, dry areas, and sea water. It is a "
"multi-annual product, typically covering a **7-year period**, and is "
"updated every 3 years. It is based on the annual Water Cover Duration (WCD) "
"production, which combines water masks from **Sentinel-1** radar and "
"**Sentinel-2** optical imagery with Water/Ice Cover data from Sentinel-2 "
"(WIC S2).\n"
"\n"
"The product is generated at the European scale with a spatial resolution of "
"**10 m × 10 m**.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability**: HRWL is available for the reference years 2021 and "
"2024, covering the periods **01/09/2016**–31/12/2021 and "
"**01/09/2018**–31/12/2024, respectively. The dataset can be downloaded in "
"multiple projections and pixel spacings.\n"
"\n"
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-layer)."
msgstr ""
"Produkten **High Resolution Water Layer (HRWL)** tillhandahåller "
"klassificerade kartor som visar permanent vatten, tillfälligt vatten, torra "
"områden och havsvatten. Det är en flerårsprodukt som vanligtvis täcker en "
"**period på 7 år** och uppdateras vart tredje år. Den bygger på den årliga "
"produktionen av Water Cover Duration (WCD), som kombinerar vattenmasker "
"från radardata från **Sentinel-1** och optiska bilder från **Sentinel-2** "
"med data om vatten-/istäcke från Sentinel-2 (WIC S2).\n"
"\n"
"Produkten genereras i europeisk skala med en spatial upplösning på **10 m × "
"10 m**.\n"
"\n"
"**Datatillgänglighet**: HRWL finns tillgänglig för referensåren 2021 och "
"2024 och täcker perioderna **01/09/2016**–31/12/2021 respektive "
"**01/09/2018**–31/12/2024. Datasetet kan laddas ner i flera projektioner "
"och pixelavstånd.\n"
"\n"
"Mer information "
"[här](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-layer)."

msgid ""
"This dataset comprises one cloud-free Very High Resolution optical coverage "
"of 39 European States (EEA-39) including all islands of those countries "
"plus \n"
"the French Overseas Departments of French Guiana, Martinique, Guadeloupe, "
"Mayotte and Réunion but excluding French Overseas Territories for a total "
"coverage \n"
"of ~ 6 million square kilometres. The area of interest is extended by a 4 "
"km buffer over the sea and a 500 m buffer over countries bordering the "
"EEA-39 states. \n"
"More "
"[info](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions/collections-description/VHR-IMAGE-2018)."
msgstr ""
"Detta dataset omfattar en molnfri optisk täckning med mycket hög upplösning "
"av 39 europeiska stater (EEA-39), inklusive alla öar som tillhör dessa "
"länder samt \n"
"de franska utomeuropeiska departementen Franska Guyana, Martinique, "
"Guadeloupe, Mayotte och Réunion men exklusive de franska utomeuropeiska "
"territorierna, med en total täckning \n"
"på cirka 6 miljoner kvadratkilometer. Intresseområdet utökas med en 4 km "
"bred buffert över havet och en 500 m bred buffert över länder som gränsar "
"till EEA-39-staterna. \n"
"Mer "
"[information](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions/collections-description/VHR-IMAGE-2018)."

